+-\x1b[1m DeviceChain - dcctl install - kind devicechain \x1b[m--------------------------------- dcctl v1.12.0 -+
| \x1b[1mHelp\x1b[m - Name the local kind cluster                                                               |
|                                                                                                  |
| Enter       use                                                                                  |
| Backspace   erase                                                                                |
| Esc         close                                                                                |
| F1          help                                                                                 |
| Ctrl+C      exit                                                                                 |
|                                                                                                  |
| Type the local kind cluster's name: Enter uses it and runs the checks again, Esc keeps the name  |
| it had. ? is part of a name here, so F1 opens help. Nothing has been changed yet: nothing on     |
| these screens changes anything until you approve the plan on the review. Ctrl+C exits.           |
